  title: Game Speed
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9a17d0b1a012c9f42b75c996b907360a, type: 3}
  description: '<color=yellow>Game Speed</color> controls the animation speed, making
    robot actions and environmental events play faster or slower.


    You can also
    change the <color=yellow>Step Delay</color>, which determines the amount of time
    between each instruction during execution.


    Adjusting Game Speed and Step
    Delay can help with debugging, understanding program flow, and speeding up repetitive
    tasks.'
  isImageBig: 0
